IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cea-elections`

-- Commonwealth Electoral Act 1918, ss 93, 100, 101, 163, 164, 166, 170, 172, 173, 245, 294, 310A -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_commonwealth-electoral-act-1918.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

